concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sec-3-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedules"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3-2 ;
    values:originalText "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms. Note: The provisions of the My Health Records (National Application) Rules 2017 amended or inserted by this Act, and any other provisions of those rules, may be amended or repealed by rules made under    No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  section 109 of the My Health Records Act 2012 (see subsection 13(5) of the Legislation Act 2003).  Schedule 1  Amendments  My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018 No. 154, 2018" ;
    skos:definition "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms. Note: The provisions of the My Health Records (National Application) Rules 2017 amended or inserted by this Act, and any other provisions of those rules, may be amended or repealed by rules made under    No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  section 109 of the My Health Records Act 2012 (see subsection 13(5) of the Legislation Act 2003).  Schedule 1  Amendments  My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018 No. 154, 2018"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f8dd3bb2ac2c0b0b2649fc1e5bec012bbd1ec466c89abf1842bc068652b2ff49" ;
    cof:pageNumber "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Legislation in schedules is amended or repealed according to its terms." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
