concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-69a-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "69A(9) Disclosure to designated entity under order by judicial officer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-69a-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) The order must:  (a) identify the healthcare recipient; and  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  (b) specify the particular information to be disclosed; and  (c) authorise one or more officers of the designated entity (whether or not named in the order) to obtain the information from the System Operator and require the System Operator to disclose the information to the designated entity; and  (d) specify the day (not more than 6 months after the making of the order) on which the order ceases to have effect; and  (e) state the purpose for which the order is made." ;
    skos:definition "(9) The order must:  (a) identify the healthcare recipient; and  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  (b) specify the particular information to be disclosed; and  (c) authorise one or more officers of the designated entity (whether or not named in the order) to obtain the information from the System Operator and require the System Operator to disclose the information to the designated entity; and  (d) specify the day (not more than 6 months after the making of the order) on which the order ceases to have effect; and  (e) state the purpose for which the order is made."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0b4be379381cb00fa25d4a54141a0d11fdc8162e5d8741444275a62768effc98" ;
    values:partOf concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-69a ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Designated entity must be informed of healthcare recipient and specified information." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
