concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-77a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77A Enforceable requirements in My Health Records Rules must"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-77a ;
    values:originalText "not be contravened: offence  (1) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity does an act or omits to do an act; and  (b) the result is that the entity contravenes a requirement imposed on the entity by My Health Records Rules made for the purposes of subsection 109(7A) and the entity is reckless as to that result; and  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  (c) the My Health Records Rules provide that the requirement is enforceable for the purposes of this paragraph; and  (d) the entity is not the System Operator, the Data Governance Board established by section 82 or the data custodian. Penalty: 100 penalty units.  (2) Strict liability applies to paragraphs (1)(c) and (d). Note: For strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code." ;
    skos:definition "not be contravened: offence  (1) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity does an act or omits to do an act; and  (b) the result is that the entity contravenes a requirement imposed on the entity by My Health Records Rules made for the purposes of subsection 109(7A) and the entity is reckless as to that result; and  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  (c) the My Health Records Rules provide that the requirement is enforceable for the purposes of this paragraph; and  (d) the entity is not the System Operator, the Data Governance Board established by section 82 or the data custodian. Penalty: 100 penalty units.  (2) Strict liability applies to paragraphs (1)(c) and (d). Note: For strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2ce999d0675ae49b6e5c9dd061c8e011915e543503b9c0ecf5a73ebb77bd33b0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-77a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-77a-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf> ;
    dc:source "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.22" .
doc:sch-2-sec-77a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "77A Enforceable requirements in My Health Records Rules must" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "not be contravened: offence  (1) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity does an act or omits to do an act; and  (b) the result is that the entity contravenes a requirement imposed on the entity by My Health Records Rules made for the purposes of subsection 109(7A) and the entity is reckless as to that result; and  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  (c) the My Health Records Rules provide that the requirement is enforceable for the purposes of this paragraph; and  (d) the entity is not the System Operator, the Data Governance Board established by section 82 or the data custodian. Penalty: 100 penalty units.  (2) Strict liability applies to paragraphs (1)(c) and (d). Note: For strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code." ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer .

concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-77a-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77A(1) Enforceable requirements in My Health Records Rules must"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-77a-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity does an act or omits to do an act; and  (b) the result is that the entity contravenes a requirement imposed on the entity by My Health Records Rules made for the purposes of subsection 109(7A) and the entity is reckless as to that result; and  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  (c) the My Health Records Rules provide that the requirement is enforceable for the purposes of this paragraph; and  (d) the entity is not the System Operator, the Data Governance Board established by section 82 or the data custodian. Penalty: 100 penalty units." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity does an act or omits to do an act; and  (b) the result is that the entity contravenes a requirement imposed on the entity by My Health Records Rules made for the purposes of subsection 109(7A) and the entity is reckless as to that result; and  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  (c) the My Health Records Rules provide that the requirement is enforceable for the purposes of this paragraph; and  (d) the entity is not the System Operator, the Data Governance Board established by section 82 or the data custodian. Penalty: 100 penalty units."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "024c3437d7e0e061874e50d8c2eadf0f8d69006835602f6c59994efb31f4cc64" ;
    values:partOf concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-77a ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Committing an act or omitting to do an act that contravenes a requirement and is reckless about the result." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf> ;
    dc:source "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.22" ;
    cml:asserts concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-77a-ss-1-norm .
