doc:sch-2-sec-77a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "77A(1) Enforceable requirements in My Health Records Rules must" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity does an act or omits to do an act; and  (b) the result is that the entity contravenes a requirement imposed on the entity by My Health Records Rules made for the purposes of subsection 109(7A) and the entity is reckless as to that result; and  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  (c) the My Health Records Rules provide that the requirement is enforceable for the purposes of this paragraph; and  (d) the entity is not the System Operator, the Data Governance Board established by section 82 or the data custodian. Penalty: 100 penalty units." ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer .

