    values:originalText "(1) Members are to be appointed by the Minister by written instrument, on a part-time basis.  (2) The Minister must appoint one member to be the Chair and another member to be the Deputy Chair.  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018" ;
