concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-88 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "88 Term of appointment and other terms and conditions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-88 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A member of the Data Governance Board holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 5 years.  (2) A member of the Data Governance Board holds office on the terms and conditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this Part that are determined by the Minister." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A member of the Data Governance Board holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 5 years.  (2) A member of the Data Governance Board holds office on the terms and conditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this Part that are determined by the Minister."@en ;
