    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-91-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Minister may terminate the appointment of a member of the Data Governance Board if:  (a) the member:  (i) becomes bankrupt; or  (ii) applies to take the benefit of any law for the relief of bankrupt or insolvent debtors; or  (iii) compounds with the member’s creditors; or  (iv) makes an assignment of the member’s remuneration for the benefit of the member’s creditors; or  (b) the member is absent, except on leave of absence, from 3 consecutive meetings of the Board; or  (c) the member engages in paid work (within the meaning of section 93) that, in the Minister’s opinion, conflicts or could conflict with the proper performance of the member’s duties (see section 93); or  (d) the member fails, without reasonable excuse, to comply with section 29 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (which deals with the duty to disclose interests) or rules made for the purposes of that section." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Minister may terminate the appointment of a member of the Data Governance Board if:  (a) the member:  (i) becomes bankrupt; or  (ii) applies to take the benefit of any law for the relief of bankrupt or insolvent debtors; or  (iii) compounds with the member’s creditors; or  (iv) makes an assignment of the member’s remuneration for the benefit of the member’s creditors; or  (b) the member is absent, except on leave of absence, from 3 consecutive meetings of the Board; or  (c) the member engages in paid work (within the meaning of section 93) that, in the Minister’s opinion, conflicts or could conflict with the proper performance of the member’s duties (see section 93); or  (d) the member fails, without reasonable excuse, to comply with section 29 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (which deals with the duty to disclose interests) or rules made for the purposes of that section."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "875d451f77dbdc39f30bd3b39bf1303d6ec396f4bf67d6a2bd0132d8537c3c7d" ;
    values:partOf concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-91 ;
    cof:pageNumber "27"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Termination of appointment under specified conditions" ;
