    skos:definition "(2) If rules made for the purposes of subsection 109(7A) require the Data Governance Board to take steps to ensure that de-identified data and health information disclosed to persons for research or public health purposes is being used only for those purposes, the System Operator must not take any steps of its own to ensure that the data and information is being used only for those purposes."@en ;
