concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-96g-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "96G(3) Delegation of functions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-96g-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In performing a delegated function or exercising a delegated power, the delegate must comply with any written directions of the Board.  Schedule 2  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018 No. 154, 2018" ;
    skos:definition "(3) In performing a delegated function or exercising a delegated power, the delegate must comply with any written directions of the Board.  Schedule 2  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018 No. 154, 2018"@en ;
