concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-96h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "96H Annual report"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-96h ;
    values:originalText "(1) As soon as practicable after the end of each financial year, the Data Governance Board must prepare and give a report to the Minister, for presentation to the Parliament, on the Board’s activities during the financial year. Note: See also section 34C of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901, which contains extra rules about annual reports.  (2) A report on the Department’s activities given under section 46 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 does not need to include a report on the activities of the Board." ;
    skos:definition "(1) As soon as practicable after the end of each financial year, the Data Governance Board must prepare and give a report to the Minister, for presentation to the Parliament, on the Board’s activities during the financial year. Note: See also section 34C of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901, which contains extra rules about annual reports.  (2) A report on the Department’s activities given under section 46 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 does not need to include a report on the activities of the Board."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8a10b71767d21a465d231ac42282dc4007d8dfcbe36829845db5efc917fb97b8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-96h-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-96h-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
