concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 Subsection 109(7A)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  My Health Records Rules may relate to research or public health purposes  (7A) The My Health Records Rules may, in accordance with section 109A, prescribe a framework to guide the collection, use and disclosure of de-identified data and, with the consent of healthcare recipients, health information, for research or public health purposes." ;
