concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-109a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "109A(4) My Health Records Rules relating to data for research or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-109a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the rules make provision for the disclosure of de-identified data or health information obtained by using or gaining access to the  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  My Health Record system, the rules must have the effect that the data or information is to be disclosed only:  (a) by means of a postal, telegraphic, telephonic or other like service; or  (b) by or to a corporation to which paragraph 51(xx) of the Constitution applies; or  (c) by or to a person within a Territory or a place acquired by the Commonwealth for a public purpose; or  (d) by or to the Commonwealth or an authority of the Commonwealth." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the rules make provision for the disclosure of de-identified data or health information obtained by using or gaining access to the  Amendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2  No. 154, 2018 My Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018  My Health Record system, the rules must have the effect that the data or information is to be disclosed only:  (a) by means of a postal, telegraphic, telephonic or other like service; or  (b) by or to a corporation to which paragraph 51(xx) of the Constitution applies; or  (c) by or to a person within a Territory or a place acquired by the Commonwealth for a public purpose; or  (d) by or to the Commonwealth or an authority of the Commonwealth."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d84c925de228c69cfda19b64862dd74177cfd4f431e9eebf662986222811238d" ;
    values:partOf concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-109a ;
    cof:pageNumber "33"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Disclosure of de-identified data or health information is restricted to specific means." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
